---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="About" description="What TIRENA is, and how it decides what to publish.">
  <section class="section" style="padding-top: 60px;">
    <div class="wrap" style="max-width: 720px;">
      <span class="eyebrow-mark"></span>
      <h1>About TIRENA</h1>
      <p>
        TIRENA is a personal-care publication built to help you understand what you're
        using, why it matters, and how to make more informed choices for your everyday routine.
      </p>
      <p>
        We cover hair care, skin care, and body care — with a focus on ingredients,
        routines, and honest comparisons rather than trends or hype. Where a claim isn't
        well established, we say so.
      </p>
      <h3 style="margin-top: 40px;">How we make money</h3>
      <p>
        Some links on TIRENA are affiliate links. If you buy something through one of
        them, we may earn a small commission — at no extra cost to you. This never
        affects which products we choose to cover or how we describe them.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
